      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of severe ventricular ischaemia induced by hyperventilation which occurred in a woman aged 44 years is presented. The ischaemia was confirmed by echocardiography and scintigraphy and coronary arteriography revealed spasm in the proximal segment of the anterior descending branch of the left coronary artery."},
